    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/b95baec4dae1a0dac612ffc20015757b.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Haru, a man who seems to be a kind soul that saved one of the bartenders at s\u00f3tano from a car crash. However, neither Haru nor the staff of\u00a0s\u00f3tano are the men they appear to be at first glance. Flirt with the sexy men running the bar. Grow close and intimate with them. Uncover the secrets of this detective agency in-disguise. All while you lay your preparations to\u2014<strong>NO, THANK YOU!!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/cb7ec5ab1fa35384bf41ba83fb7bcf38.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/19cd79a7b024d31b0db7c477a6f60994.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a dark mystery lying behind a comic veneer and uncover the secrets each character harbors in order to reach each man's true endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/b1a54f99671d9f023e1c0bf2b7913427.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both the protagonist and all the romanceable men are fully voiced, even during the sex scenes! Enjoy the wonderful talents of Furukawa Tetsuto (<i>Trinity Universe</i>),\u00a0Murakami Kazuya (<i>Hakuouki</i>),\u00a0Tamaru Ryu (<i>Touken Ranbu</i>,\u00a0<i>Samurai Flamenco</i>), and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/304332262542cacccf0e617fffba6bf0.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/92dcfeb62a56e3e27b3671307b4cb547.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the game, the &quot;NO, THANK YOU!!!&quot; button will appear at key, critical moments, and it's up to you to decide whether to proceed, or reject the choice the protagonist is about to make. What choices are those? That's a mystery you'll have to intuit from the story! Just know that choosing wrongly can lead to fatal consequences!<br><br>(Note: A Hint Mode which reveals more of the protagonist's thoughts is unlocked after your first playthrough.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/16be87fca50c59320647dabfc99a520e.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/b95baec4dae1a0dac612ffc20015757b.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Haru, a man who seems to be a kind soul that saved one of the bartenders at s\u00f3tano from a car crash. However, neither Haru nor the staff of\u00a0s\u00f3tano are the men they appear to be at first glance. Flirt with the sexy men running the bar. Grow close and intimate with them. Uncover the secrets of this detective agency in-disguise. All while you lay your preparations to\u2014<strong>NO, THANK YOU!!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/cb7ec5ab1fa35384bf41ba83fb7bcf38.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/19cd79a7b024d31b0db7c477a6f60994.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a dark mystery lying behind a comic veneer and uncover the secrets each character harbors in order to reach each man's true endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/b1a54f99671d9f023e1c0bf2b7913427.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both the protagonist and all the romanceable men are fully voiced, even during the sex scenes! Enjoy the wonderful talents of Furukawa Tetsuto (<i>Trinity Universe</i>),\u00a0Murakami Kazuya (<i>Hakuouki</i>),\u00a0Tamaru Ryu (<i>Touken Ranbu</i>,\u00a0<i>Samurai Flamenco</i>), and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/304332262542cacccf0e617fffba6bf0.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/92dcfeb62a56e3e27b3671307b4cb547.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the game, the &quot;NO, THANK YOU!!!&quot; button will appear at key, critical moments, and it's up to you to decide whether to proceed, or reject the choice the protagonist is about to make. What choices are those? That's a mystery you'll have to intuit from the story! Just know that choosing wrongly can lead to fatal consequences!<br><br>(Note: A Hint Mode which reveals more of the protagonist's thoughts is unlocked after your first playthrough.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975000/extras/16be87fca50c59320647dabfc99a520e.avif?t=1753988916\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
    "short_description": "NO, THANK YOU!!! is a dark, dramatic mystery hidden behind a comic veneer as all of the men in this yaoi visual novel harbor their own secrets. Uncover the mystery behind the protagonist and this bar disguising a detective agency while flirting with the guys and growing intimate with them.",
